Healers are *not* slow at looting.  I don't think there's anything
faster, except for the archaeologist who can put valuable gems in
their sack along with their coins and let their pet steal the sack.
With high starting gold and high charisma, healers require way fewer
gold-pile-pickups than other classes.  And the stethoscope gives them
a safe, turn-free method to detect mimics.  If your healer is slow at
looting, you're doing it wrong.

